    "detailed_description": "The Tower of Whispers is a rogue-lite hack-and-slash dungeon crawler where you fight your way through the tower, with each floor more treacherous than the last, to harness its powers and unveil its secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/4eb5d82d66338024509437f1e178d7ca.poster.avif?t=1749804925\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/4eb5d82d66338024509437f1e178d7ca.webm?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/4eb5d82d66338024509437f1e178d7ca.mp4?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience thrilling isometric combat, engaging rogue-lite gameplay, and extensive build customization. Delve into the bowels of the tower, where each floor poses new challenges and hidden treasures. Discover a myriad of items that will not only aid you in battle but also allow you to tailor your character's abilities and playstyle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/f26937ba574876bd75b93bfcd0a44fa9.avif?t=1749804925\" width=600 height=106 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unveil the tower's Secrets</h2></h2>Explore the floors of the Tower of Whispers and learn to wield its not-so-chaotic nature to your advantage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/bbc407d6471e4308441da56c773a3ae2.poster.avif?t=1749804925\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/bbc407d6471e4308441da56c773a3ae2.webm?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/bbc407d6471e4308441da56c773a3ae2.mp4?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The flow of time itself is convoluted; with heroes centuries old phasing in and out</h2>Experience the tower through the eyes of different heroes. Dash and slash your enemies with the thorned knight, Electrocute them from afar with the storm wielder, drag them down to the deepest depths with the sea hunter, and many more to be discovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek help from the past... or the future</h2></h2>Make use of the dearest objects left behind by other heroes lost to the treacherous tower and infuse mementos into these relics to make them even more powerful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's as many stories as lost souls in this Tower</h2>Discover the stories of the souls trapped within the tower and its mysterious servants that inhabit it. Each relic is filled with extensive lore about the tower, its origins, and purpose.",
    "about_the_game": "The Tower of Whispers is a rogue-lite hack-and-slash dungeon crawler where you fight your way through the tower, with each floor more treacherous than the last, to harness its powers and unveil its secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/4eb5d82d66338024509437f1e178d7ca.poster.avif?t=1749804925\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/4eb5d82d66338024509437f1e178d7ca.webm?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/4eb5d82d66338024509437f1e178d7ca.mp4?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience thrilling isometric combat, engaging rogue-lite gameplay, and extensive build customization. Delve into the bowels of the tower, where each floor poses new challenges and hidden treasures. Discover a myriad of items that will not only aid you in battle but also allow you to tailor your character's abilities and playstyle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/f26937ba574876bd75b93bfcd0a44fa9.avif?t=1749804925\" width=600 height=106 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unveil the tower's Secrets</h2></h2>Explore the floors of the Tower of Whispers and learn to wield its not-so-chaotic nature to your advantage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/bbc407d6471e4308441da56c773a3ae2.poster.avif?t=1749804925\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/bbc407d6471e4308441da56c773a3ae2.webm?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833980/extras/bbc407d6471e4308441da56c773a3ae2.mp4?t=1749804925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The flow of time itself is convoluted; with heroes centuries old phasing in and out</h2>Experience the tower through the eyes of different heroes. Dash and slash your enemies with the thorned knight, Electrocute them from afar with the storm wielder, drag them down to the deepest depths with the sea hunter, and many more to be discovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek help from the past... or the future</h2></h2>Make use of the dearest objects left behind by other heroes lost to the treacherous tower and infuse mementos into these relics to make them even more powerful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's as many stories as lost souls in this Tower</h2>Discover the stories of the souls trapped within the tower and its mysterious servants that inhabit it. Each relic is filled with extensive lore about the tower, its origins, and purpose.",
    "short_description": "Fight. Die. Rise. Until your vow is fulfilled. Tower of Whispers is a dark isometric action rogue-lite where ruthless, combo-driven combat meets a tower twisted by cursed echoes and buried sins. Every fight tests your skill. Every floor leads you deeper.",
